  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AIDS CONTROL PROJECT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project aims to improve Moldova&apos;s health status and assist the country to achieve its health-related Millennium Development Goals (MDG) through reducing mortality, morbidity and transmission of HIV/AIDS, and other sexually transmitted infections (STIs). Specifically, the project would support Moldova&apos;s National Program for Prevention and Control of HIV/AIDS/STIs (NPAS) through:  (i)   scaling up HIV/AIDS/STIs prevention programs targeted at vulnerable and highly vulnerable groups (young people, IDUS, CSWs, MSM, etc); (ii)   strengthening treatment, care and support for people living with HIV/AIDS (PLWHA); and (iii) strengthening Moldova&apos;s institutional capacity to better respond to HIV/AIDS/STIs  in a  multi-sectoral approach.</narrative>
  </description>
